OL,3,GNEWSAFootage shows Dexter 'kill room'
OL,4,Amurderer's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released body-worn video of
OL,7,Fthe moment a university forensics
OL,8,Fstudent was arrested for stabbing to
OL,9,Fwoman to death in a "kill room" copied
OL,10,Ffrom US TV show Dexter.
OL,12,FThe footage shows Benjamin Day, who cut
OL,13,Fopen his hand while attempting to
OL,14,Fdismember the body of Maria Saceanu,
OL,15,Flying to officers after the killing,
OL,16,Fclaiming to have been bitten by a wild
OL,17,Fdog or a fox.
OL,19,FDay, 20, changed his plea at
OL,20,FWolverhampton Crown Court on Tuesday to
OL,21,Fadmit to murdering the 24-year-old
OL,22,FRomanian.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
